        <detaileddescription>
<para>Assemble multiple fragments into a non-fragmented bundle</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fragments</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The fragments to assemble </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>bundle[out]</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The assembled bundle</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if successfully assembled, false otherwise</para>
</simplesect>
The fragment bundles are not modified. All fragments must be present (though may possibly overlap). See RFC5050 for details.</para>
<para>All fragments must have been fragmented from the same original bundle (allowing for multiple fragmenting sessions). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
